Changes for Android, made by build.sh: every JNI entry point in the SWIG wrapper
(nativeSwigWrapperLibraries/c_jni_wrapper/fmod_wrap.c) first attaches its thread
to ART via wm_attach_art() (onload.c), and the library is built for arm64-v8a.
